      ...close([['I can ask «How would you feel if you …?»', 'How would you feel if you did archery?'], ['I can say «I would feel …».', 'I would feel excited.'], ["I can talk about my family's hobbies.", 'We go on long walks. We would feel happy.']], { img: G('cover-004'), q: 'How do you make a paper airplane?', ko: '종이비행기, 어떻게 접을까요? (다음 시간)' }),
